        "data": {
          "why_not_mark_self_checked_zh": "组织方的 `--mark-self-checked` 会用它自己的 checks 数组重写 `self_check.json`，那会删掉本包写在其中的 131 条 `PKG_` 读数——正是让这份文件值得一读的那些闸门读数。因此本包不用那个开关：本函数在每次刷新时先把这个标志清为 false（新摘要尚未被核过），再由 `finalise_claim` 在**通过**的一次运行之后置回 true；manifest 不含自身的摘要，写这一个字段不会使任何摘要失效。四道组织方闸门的实跑结果在 `self_check.json` 里逐条可读。",
          "why_not_mark_self_checked_en": "The organisers' --mark-self-checked rewrites self_check.json with its own checks array, which would delete the 131 PKG_ readings this package writes there - the gate readings that make the file worth reading. So that switch is not used: this function clears the flag on every refresh, because digests nobody has checked yet cannot be claimed as checked, and finalise_claim sets it back to true after a passing run. The manifest carries no digest of itself, so writing this one field invalidates nothing. The four organiser gates and their results are readable row by row in self_check.json.",
          "four_gate_result_lives_in": "self_check.json"
        }
      }
    }
  }
